=:warning: *Lead could not be classified*

*Name:* {{ $json.lead.name }}
*Email:* {{ $json.lead.email || 'n/a' }}
*Phone:* {{ $json.lead.phone || 'n/a' }}
*Enquiry:* {{ $json.lead.vehicle_interest || 'n/a' }}

*Raw AI output:* {{ $json.ai_decision.reason }}
*Parse failed:* {{ $json.ai_decision.parse_failed }}

This lead was NOT routed automatically. Please review and assign it manually.

